      "content": "66|# Example: Smoke on the Silt Road\n67|\n68|**Posted by:** A Concerned Freight Owner  \n69|**DM:** Initiate of Tribulation, Vorg Lordcaster\n70|**Tier:** Tier 1  \n71|**Recommended Level:** 3 - 4  \n72|**Expected Length:** ~4 hours \n73|**Tone:** Roadside crime, caravan trouble, Arcannabis weirdness  \n74|**Location:** [[The Silt Road]]  \n75|**Legality:** Gray trending rapidly toward illegal  \n76|\n77|### Coded Notice\n78|\n79|> **Need discreet hands for cargo retrieval. Shipment is breathing. Do not involve road authorities. Do not open the third crate. Payment upon silence.**\n80|\n81|### What the Job Actually Is\n82|\n83|A shipment of [[Arcannabis]] bound for the [[Zooka Mire Collective]] has become stranded along [[The Silt Road]] after interference from the [[Cough City Crew]]. The cargo is beginning to show signs of magical instability, and [[Skarguther Dungleboof]] wants the matter handled before anyone respectable notices.\n84|\n85|### What Players Should Know\n86|\n87|- **Content / vibe:** Strange roadside encounters, criminal incompetence, magical contraband comedy.\n88|- **Combat / roleplay / exploration mix:** Balanced, with investigation, negotiation, and likely violence near a wagon.\n89|- **Character hooks:** Good for smugglers, bounty hunters, Arcannabis enthusiasts, Zooka Mire contacts, or anyone who owes [[Skarguther Dungleboof]] a favor.\n90|- **Complications:** Rival criminals, unstable cargo, witnesses, and the possibility that the third crate has opinions.\n91|- **Lines not to cross:** Keep it goofy-criminal, not grimdark-criminal.\n92|\n93|### Rewards Teaser\n94|\n95|Payment may include coin, a favor from [[Skarguther Dungleboof]], access to unusual [[Arcannabis]], or information about who has been interfering with trade along [[The Silt Road]].\n96|\n97|### Sign-Up\n98|\n99|**DM:** Chase  \n100|**Date / Time:** TBD  \n101|**Seats:** 4 - 5 players  ",
